    // Store the K rows of the minibatch. Main (worker_ix 0) and the main
    // helpers (worker_ix 1 .. n_workers - 1) call this with the same
    // operation at the same point of the schedule. In the generated plugins,
    // run() passes 0 and n_workers, and run_main_help passes its worker_ix
    // and n_workers. See Note [Shared block save]. The defaults store every
    // row on the calling thread.
